msgid "Gachana Charity Association is a non-profit organization based in Dire Dawa, founded three years ago, currently providing services within Dire Dawa, with a future goal of expanding its support across Ethiopia. The association focuses on education, healthcare, skills training, women's empowerment, and children's welfare to promote self-reliance and improve community well-being."
msgstr "Waltajjii Tola Ooltummaa Gachanaa dhaabbata tola ooltummaa Dirree Dhawaatti argamu yoo ta'u, waggaa sadii dura kan hundeeffame, yeroo ammaa tajaajila Dirree Dhawa keessatti kennuu fi gara fuulduraatti deeggarsa isaa Itoophiyaa guutuutti babal'isuu kan kaayyeffatedha. Waltajjiin kun barnoota, fayyaa, leenjii ogummaa, humna dubartootaa fi kunuunsa daa'immanii irratti xiyyeeffachuun of danda'uu fi mijataa hawaasaa fooyyessuuf hojjeta."
